2
nanoparticle (SiO
2
@MnO
2
) based on silica microbeads, which enabled the isolation and recovery of fNRBCs in early pregnancy. They prepared SiO
2
@MnO
2
, modified by anti-CD147, and used oxalic acid to dissolve the MnO
2
nanoparticle coating, thereby releasing fNRBCs, and finally used FISH and STR techniques to detect the captured fNRBCs (Fig.
4
c). This platform provides a low-cost and easy-to-operate solution for NIPD.
